aw titan he used this form to  help the warriors and the survey corps  fight against aaron's founding titan dot  pixas sometime after ingesting zeke's  spinal fluid dot pixis was transformed  into a pure titan during the merlion  surprise attack pixas's pure titan is  spotted by arman who expresses gratitude  for pixis's guidance as he fires a  thunderspear which brings an end to the  former commander rod reese as the only  surviving member of his family rod  decided to persuade his daughter  hystoria into devouring aaron into  becoming the next founding titan but  after she refuses to do so he took titan  serum by himself and became the largest  abnormal titan in existence way larger  than even a colossal titan zeke jaeger  zeke yeager was forced into becoming a  warrior by his parents and later on  proved himself to be good enough to  inherit the beast titan he inherited  titan powers from his father figure tom  saver and in combination with his royal  blood he became extremely powerful jean  connie and gabby gene kersting connie  springer and gabby braun were very  fortunate to be among the rest of the  eldian people who escaped fort slava  they were previously battling aaron's  founding titan and after escaping they  saw that the centipede survived the  explosion and started emitting smoke all  of the aliens in fort slava were  transformed into pure tights and  immediately went to protect the  centipede as it attempts to return to  aaron aaron jaeger aaron is the  character with the most different titan  forms in the series first of all he has  his pure titan form which he was  transformed into when grisha injected  him with the serum next up is his attack  titan form this is aaron's standard form  that we're used to seeing in the anime  in season 4 after he ate lara tiber he  changed his appearance yet again and  became the fusion of the warhammer and  the attack titan after initiating the  rumbling he gained the power of the  founding titan from ymir fritz and